ent-Pickaxe = 鎬 | pickaxe
    .desc = 切口精準無瑕，專為卡入岩石而設計。 | Notched to perfection, for jamming it into rocks.
ent-MiningDrill = 採礦鑽機 | mining drill
    .desc = 一種用於快速鑽穿岩石的強力工具。 | Powerful tool used to quickly drill through rocks.
ent-MiningDrillDiamond = 金剛石鑽頭 | diamond tipped mining drill
    .desc = 一款效率顯著提升、鑲有鑽石的採礦鑽頭。 | A significantly more efficient mining drill tipped with diamond.
ent-BaseWeaponCrusher = 破碎機 | crusher
    .desc = 原型動能加速器的早期設計。 | An early design of the proto-kinetic accelerator.
ent-WeaponCrusher = { ent-BaseWeaponCrusher }
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponCrusher.desc }
ent-WeaponCrusherDagger = 粉碎匕首 | crusher dagger
    .desc = 一種原型動能粉碎機的縮小版。利用動能使刀片高速振動。 | A scaled down version of a proto-kinetic crusher. Uses kinetic energy to vibrate the blade at high speeds.
ent-WeaponCrusherGlaive = 粉碎長鎚 | crusher glaive
    .desc = 原型動能加速器的早期設計，呈長矛形狀。能提供更佳的治療效果，但代價是帶電傷害較低。 | An early design of the proto-kinetic accelerator, in glaive form. Provides better healing in exchange for less charged damage.
